  "description": "This package provides a flexible and generic database abstraction with a dedicated PostgreSQL provider.\n\t\t\tIt supports asynchronous execution of SQL commands, stored procedures, and parameterized queries using PostgreSQL via Npgsql.\n\t\t\tDesigned for extensibility and seamless dependency injection, it fits naturally within repository-pattern architectures.\n\t\t\tThe package enables clean multi-database integration while offering efficient, type-safe data access for .NET applications.",
